      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0541.ayton_penthon.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0541_ayton_penthon">
        <head>ΑΥΤΟΝ ΠΕΝΘΩΝ</head>
        <pb n="93" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044098646714:scan:117" />
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-ayton_penthon-1">
          <head rendition="#center">Ι.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-ayton_penthon-1-l1">Τυφλὸν ὁ πλοῦτος, καὶ τυφλοὺς</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-ayton_penthon-1-l2">τοὺς ἐμβλέποντας εἰς ἑαυτὸν δεικνύει.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="apparatus">Stobaeus Flor. XCIII 21. Libri τυφλοὺς ἐμβλέποντες εἰς αὐτόν. Correxit Bentleius; articulum addidit etiam Steph. Proleg. ad Com. Gr. p. 25. Simillimam sententiam Antiphanis vide vol. III p. 153 (inc. fab. LXI b).</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-ayton_penthon-2">
          <head rendition="#center">ΙΙ.</head>
          <note type="source">Harpocratio p. 169 22: στεφανῶν τοὺς νενικηκότας, Δημοσθένης ἐν τῷ κατ᾿ Αἰσχίνου, ἀντὶ τοῦ τιμῶν. — καὶ παρ᾿ ἄλλοις ἐπὶ ταύτης τῆς ἐννοίας τὸ στεφανοῦν, ὡς παρὰ Θεοπόμπῳ ἐν ζ΄ καὶ Μενάνδρῳ ἐν Αὑτὸν πενθοῦντι.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Vide edit. mai.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0541-ayton_penthon-6">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0541-ayton_penthon-6-l1">Caeca res pecunia est;</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0541-ayton_penthon-6-l2">quique aciem in se defigunt, hos caecos facit.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
